{"id":"4b301a7129d70d59","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-positive-prime-type-realization.md","title":"Sigma-One Realization of Positively Prime Types","display":"thm-positive-prime-type-realization — Sigma-One Realization of Positively Prime Types","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-positive-prime-type-realization","aliases":["67-thm-positive-prime-type-realization"],"display":"thm-positive-prime-type-realization — Sigma-One Realization of Positively Prime Types","depends_on":["[[67-df-independence-type]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":3,"source_label":"discussion before Theorem 5; Theorem 5","source_printed_pages":"46–49","source_pdf_pages":"57–60","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_status":"陈述已与原书逐项核对；已读源证明，未独立形式化其全部算术化细节"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-positive-prime-type-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-positive-prime-type-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-positive-prime-type-realization — Sigma-One Realization of Positively Prime Types"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74fe2bcb840f383c\" href=\"?note=74fe2bcb840f383c\" title=\"67-df-independence-type\">67-df-independence-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"source_label","html":"discussion before Theorem 5; Theorem 5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"46–49"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"57–60"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述已与原书逐项核对；已读源证明，未独立形式化其全部算术化细节"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是一致原始递归公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Type}(F)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type},\\mathrm{PP},\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Type},\\mathrm{PP},\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74fe2bcb840f383c\" href=\"?note=74fe2bcb840f383c\" title=\"67-df-independence-type\">67-df-independence-type</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]=\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]=\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\\)</span>，数词实例都代入指定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PP}(F)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T(\\xi,F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PP}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T(\\xi,F)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PP}(F)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T(\\xi,F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PP}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T(\\xi,F)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.46 在 Theorem 3.5 前说明必要性，并于 pp.46–49 证明充分性。充分性不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>-sound；只有把它提升成充要条件时才使用该额外假设。</p>\n<p>必要性的本地论证：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明若干 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 数词实例的有限析取，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可靠性使该析取在标准模型中为真，故某一实例为真；Q 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 完备性遂给出该实例在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中可证，于是对应正命题变量属于 F。充分性的来源证明是原书特有的阶段构造，使用正素公式的约束和可在 PA 中形式化的有限真值赋值修正；已读证明结构与 Claims 1–2，但没有独立验证每条阶段编码等式，保留受限证明资格。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-independence-type","status":"resolved","id":"74fe2bcb840f383c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-independence-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-independence-type","status":"resolved","id":"74fe2bcb840f383c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是一致原始递归公理呈示，$F$ 是 $\\mathrm{Type}(F)$；$\\mathrm{Type},\\mathrm{PP},\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T$ 见 [[67-df-independence-type]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1$、$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}$ 分别见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]、[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1$、$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}$ 分别见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]、[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\m